abstract: "Exact computer-assisted proof in dimension eight for the periodic directional bent-derivative formulation, relative to the Gillot–Langevin affine classification of seven-variable cubics. Archive includes witnesses for 768 balanced representatives and a verifier; the author-hosted classification catalogue is not redistributed."
